  "implementation": [
    "Expose the two pre-existing receipt-bound natural single-block Ready harnesses through package scripts and the generated tool inventory, explicitly declaring archive-RPC cost and not dual/performance scope.",
    "Preserve default WETH Yield Basis sample; add cbBTC/WBTC output-only sample assertions. No sample registry is consumed as a production identity or admission allowlist.",
    "Bind ordinary Yield Basis deposit/withdraw observations to successful call/event/return and independent mint/transfer evidence. Emergency exits do not satisfy ordinary withdrawal.",
    "Borrow only a saved production underlying amountIn. Generate reverse test input from independently measured current target deposit receipts, not a donor output. This is an independent same-N reverse test, not a composed transaction or natural WETH valuation.",
    "Register cUNI as a separate original redeemUnderlying sample; preserve cUSDC/cDAI. Burned shares from the matched Redeem observation become a current redeem input, not the original underlying-output calldata.",
    "Add six offline cUNI tests with twenty negative mutations and a tool-registration cost/scope regression."
  ],
